### Login direto do juliang pelo sistema KYROSPORTAL (F1-11)
# O sistema se autentica por HTTP Basic (client_id:segredo); o usuário vai no corpo.
# Funciona no IntelliJ (HTTP Client) e no VS Code (extensão REST Client).
# Ver docs/simulacao-login-kyrosportal.md.

@sentryAuth = http://localhost:8081
@clientId = KYROSPORTAL
@clientSecret = kyros-portal-segredo-local

POST {{sentryAuth}}/api/v1/auth/login
Authorization: Basic {{clientId}} {{clientSecret}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "juliang",
  "password": "Kyros@123",
  "scope": "openid profile email offline_access"
}

### Senha errada: 401 invalid_grant e INVALID_CREDENTIALS em access_logs

POST {{sentryAuth}}/api/v1/auth/login
Authorization: Basic {{clientId}} {{clientSecret}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "juliang",
  "password": "senha-errada"
}

### Renovar os tokens com o refresh_token da primeira resposta

POST {{sentryAuth}}/oauth2/token
Authorization: Basic {{clientId}} {{clientSecret}}
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

grant_type=refresh_token&refresh_token=<cole aqui o refresh_token>
